nd_Logos_520px_040126_Found.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2108/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Found.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2108/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Found.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2108/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Found.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2108/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Found.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2108/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Found.jpg","Obesity is one of the leading causes of preventable death in the United States, and by 2030, nearly half of the population will be clinically obese. Society tells us that if we eat less and exercise more, we’ll lose weight and enjoy a better quality of life, but when we don’t find success, we’re shamed for our lack of willpower. In reality, it’s not that simple; medical research reveals a wide range of biological, psychological and environmental factors play a role in weight loss. Obesity is a disease, not a decision, and it needs to be treated like one.\r\n\r\nFound, a digital-first weight care company, delivers a comprehensive wellness program of evaluation, medication and lifestyle coaching that breaks down the stigmas surrounding weight to help its members change their relationships with their bodies. Powered by expert-led clinical research, this breakout company has helped tens of thousands keep up with their grandchildren, fit into their wedding rings again and find healthier and more fulfilled versions of themselves. Finally, democratized integrated weight care has been Found.","Powered by clinical research, Found is a digital-first weight care company helping members change their relationships with their bodies for the better.","Found - IVP Portfolio - Digital Health & Wellness VC","Found - IVP Portfolio","A digital-first integrated weight care management company ",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,